  (8) The entropy classes {6.0, 5.5, 5.0} bits (Corollary 8.3).

10.2 DISCLOSED INPUTS

  (S1)-(S3) Substrate, Laplacian, and L = 8 selection (HCSM-01, HCSM-14.b).
  (P1) Identification of the 14 modes with one Standard Model generation
       (HCSM-23, Section 3).
  (P7) N/4 mass-ordering labels (HCSM-23, Input 3).
